<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Aphra, the Illustrious Rouge Redstar, and Those Damn Cylinder Heads</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Chelli and her crew have been through a lot, whether meeting Steven Universe, a group of space pirates led by the willful Marika Kato, or coming across Korra, Asami, Lin, Tenzin, and others in Republic City. Tensions are growing, especially after what Chelli and Entrapta (known as Apta for short) overheard one recent night. This will all come out into the open after they meet an android woman named Rouge Redstar, helping her fight powerful war machines which shoot deadly lasers, causing fissures among the crew of the Darla Angel which cannot easily be mended, and changing all of their lives forever, especially those of Glimmer, Bow, Adora, and Catra.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>lefemmerouge2</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
